SUMMARY:BEKSCITY Run: Signature Run
LOCATION:MKO Stadium\, Abeokuta\, Ogun State\, Nigeria
DESCRIPTION:BEKSCITY RUN CLUB — Signature Run\nCategory: Monthly Signature Event\nDistrict: ALL DISTRICTS\nMeeting Point: MKO Stadium\nDistance: 7.5 km\nRoute Stops: Stadium perimeter & boulevard course\n\nPLANNED ACTIVITIES:\nTrack warm-up\, pacing groups (Beginner\, Intermediate\, Fast)\, and cool-down stretch.\n\nABOUT THIS RUN:\nFlagship monthly signature run congregating at MKO Stadium. Pacing groups organized for all fitness levels to build running endurance and camaraderie.\n\nSTANDARD SCHEDULE:\n• 06:45 AM — Check-in and gathering\n• 07:00 AM — Warm-up session\n• 07:15 AM — Group run departs\n• 08:15 AM — Cooldown & stretching\n• 08:30 AM — Refreshments & community social\n\nBEKSCITY RUN CLUB | Keep Moving Forward
